                        <seg type="rubrication">Headings and first lines of constituent texts;
                           nomina sacra; 
 some of the musical notation signs above the lines;
                           elements of the punctuation signs; 
 abbreviations; 
 the words
                           ወካዕበ፡, ወእምዝ፡, በዝየ፡, ጸልዩ፡, ንበል፡, etc. (occasionally only partially
